OL,3,AIran says US strike killed four at
OL,4,Awedding in 'war crime' as US denies
OL,5,Atargeting civilians
OL,6,
OL,7,FIran has accused the US of a war crime
OL,8,Fafter officials said a missile strike
OL,9,Fkilled four people including two
OL,10,Fchildren at a wedding celebration.
OL,12,FThe Iranian Red Crescent Society (IRCS)
OL,13,Fsaid shrapnel from a missile hit a
OL,14,Ffamily wedding ceremony at a home in
OL,15,Fsouthern Iran, causing the deaths.
OL,16,FIranian foreign ministry spokesman
OL,17,FEsmaeil Baqaei called the incident a
OL,18,F"war crime".
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
