OL,3,AIran says US strike killed four at
OL,4,Awedding in 'war crime' as US denies
OL,5,Atargeting civilians
OL,6,
OL,7,FA US Central Command (Centcom)
OL,8,Fspokesperson said it "never targets
OL,9,Fcivilians", adding that it was aware of
OL,10,Fthe reports.
OL,12,FIranian authorities said another 14
OL,13,Fpeople were killed elsewhere. In
OL,14,Fresponse, Iran launched missiles and
OL,15,Fdrones at US targets in Jordan, Kuwait,
OL,16,FIraq and Bahrain.
